<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSSx1" title="In Appendix A Appendix: Metric Computation and Normalization ‣ A 1000× Faster LLM-enhanced Algorithm For Path Planning in Large-scale Grid Maps" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Raw Metric Aggregation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSSx2" title="In Appendix A Appendix: Metric Computation and Normalization ‣ A 1000× Faster LLM-enhanced Algorithm For Path Planning in Large-scale Grid Maps" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Normalization for Cost-Type Metrics</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSSx3" title="In Appendix A Appendix: Metric Computation and Normalization ‣ A 1000× Faster LLM-enhanced Algorithm For Path Planning in Large-scale Grid Maps" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Final Score Calculation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSSx4" title="In Appendix A Appendix: Metric Computation and Normalization ‣ A 1000× Faster LLM-enhanced Algorithm For Path Planning in Large-scale Grid Maps" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Path Length Evaluation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
  <a id="license-tr" href="https://info.arxiv.org/help/license/index.html#licenses-available">
